msgstr "部署架构"

#: ../../getting-started/deployment.md:43 b4ae452ebdac45929da2c23b86c45cbf
msgid "Option 1: Direct Deployment (Recommended for Self-Hosting)"
msgstr "方案 1：直接部署（推荐用于自托管）"

#: ../../getting-started/deployment.md:69 0afcc48a857f44248ae2550ab758d358
msgid ""
"`npm run start:no-auth` sets `AUTH_MODE=disabled`. Anyone who can reach "
"the service gets admin-level access, so use it only behind trusted "
"network access or another access-control layer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting-started/deployment.md:71 4c282561cf574f4d9bd30e2e85d710ef
msgid "Option 2: PM2 Process Manager"
msgstr "方案 2：PM2 进程管理器"

#: ../../getting-started/deployment.md:73 c266400680e34edabb73d1e9f20fbaee
msgid ""
"[PM2](https://pm2.keymetrics.io/) keeps your application running in the "
"background and auto-restarts on crashes."
msgstr "[PM2](https://pm2.keymetrics.io/) 可以让您的应用程序在后台运行，并在崩溃时自动重启。"

#: ../../getting-started/deployment.md:97 19abea0f30ca4135b40b6639c742abdf
